<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/04RP">Proposition <span data-tag="04RP">10.1.2.14</span>.</a> The diagram of $\infty $-categories </p>
<div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix@R =50pt@C=50pt{ \operatorname{N}_{\bullet }( \operatorname{{\bf \Delta }}_{\operatorname{inj}} ) \ar [r] \ar [d] &amp;  \operatorname{N}_{\bullet }( \operatorname{{\bf \Delta }}) \ar [d] \\ \operatorname{N}_{\bullet }( \operatorname{{\bf \Delta }}_{\operatorname{inj}, +} ) \ar [r] &amp;  \operatorname{N}_{\bullet }( \operatorname{{\bf \Delta }}_{+} ) } \]
</div>
<p> is a categorical pushout square. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
<p>
<strong>Proof.</strong>
      By virtue of Proposition <a data-tag="02NR" href="/tag/02NR">7.2.2.1</a>, this is a reformulation of Proposition <a data-tag="04RE" href="/tag/04RE">10.1.2.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
</p>
